(* ::Text:: Expansion of B-period (normalised by Sqrt[3]/2/Pi) at the conifold point. Recall that C2= y*Grad[1/Subscript[C, 1], y]*y*Grad[Subscript[\[CapitalPi], B], y] = (\[CapitalDelta] - 1)*Grad[1/Subscript[C, 1], \[CapitalDelta]]*(\[CapitalDelta] - 1)*Grad[Subscript[\[CapitalPi], B], \[CapitalDelta]] where \[CapitalDelta]=(1+27 DisplayForm[FormBox[RowBox[{RowBox[{"y", ")"}], "=", SuperscriptBox["L", RowBox[{"-", "3"}]]}], TraditionalForm]]. So, expand first Subscript[C, 2] at \[CapitalDelta]=0... *)

